# Canonicalize the hostname: send www -> apex (non-www) with a permanent 301.
# Without this, www.arismobiledetailing.com/* serves the same pages at HTTP 200,
# and Google files every www URL under "Alternate page with proper canonical tag."
# :splat preserves the rest of the path. Apex then handles .html/trailing-slash
# normalization via Cloudflare's built-in 307s.
https://www.arismobiledetailing.com/* https://arismobiledetailing.com/:splat 301
